---
description: ClassPulse project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- This is an existing, working app. Read the current code before changing anything and follow its existing structure, naming and style.
- Never rewrite or restructure the app. Make the smallest change that fixes the problem.
- Never remove or rename existing features, routes, or demo logins (ADMIN001, FAC001-003, STU001-012).
- Every route must check authentication, role and ownership on the server. Never trust the client.
- Escape all user text when rendering. Use parameterized queries only. Never put secrets in code.
- After any change, run the app and the test script, and report what passed and what failed.
- Do not add new dependencies unless needed, and say why.
